0481                         ; -----------------------------------------------------
0482                         ; Word pointer table (max words 256)
0483                         ; Set X to the pointer ID and call PR_WORD
0484                         ; -----------------------------------------------------
0485                         ; To create new wordk add the word in the correct
0486                         ; (alphabetical) position in the word table. Then add
0487                         ; a pointer to that word at the END of the Word Pointer
0488                         ; table. Finally add an EQUATE using the word as a label
0489                         ; in the word equates table;
0490                         ; -----------------------------------------------------
